        "name": "Réponse CF / Bureau"
      },
      "value": "<p>La réponse du Conseil fédéral n'existe qu'en allemand. (Veuillez changer la langue en haut à droite de la page d'accueil)</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": {
        "id": 5,
        "name": "Texte déposé"
      },
      "value": "<p>Le Conseil fédéral voulait communiquer « au troisième trimestre 2024 » sur les expulsions effectivement exécutées suite à l’acceptation de l’initiative sur le renvoi (<a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.parlament.ch%2Fde%2Fratsbetrieb%2Fsuche-curia-vista%2Fgeschaeft%3FAffairId%3D20090060&amp;data=05%7C02%7Czs.kanzlei%40parl.admin.ch%7C16c0a6cbfa8d44bccb8608dcd23af1c7%7C0cf3ddc638a5480885f1cae22925a1b0%7C0%7C0%7C638616397805835247%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ilUc0bnmurYctxvSs%2BU6zOi0pDkMqsd2csgOKfa%2Blyg%3D&amp;reserved=0\">09.060</a>/<a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.parlament.ch%2Fde%2Fratsbetrieb%2Fsuche-curia-vista%2Fgeschaeft%3FAffairId%3D20200025&amp;data=05%7C02%7Czs.kanzlei%40parl.admin.ch%7C16c0a6cbfa8d44bccb8608dcd23af1c7%7C0cf3ddc638a5480885f1cae22925a1b0%7C0%7C0%7C638616397805835247%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=83NRkJN5ttZn6nNgZAI8dXQBqe%2BV8%2FzkIwe93RBT9J0%3D&amp;reserved=0\">20.025</a>) du 28&nbsp;novembre 2010 (!) (17&nbsp;: <a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.parlament.ch%2Fde%2Fratsbetrieb%2Fsuche-curia-vista%2Fgeschaeft%3FAffairId%3D20175098&amp;data=05%7C02%7Czs.kanzlei%40parl.admin.ch%7C16c0a6cbfa8d44bccb8608dcd23af1c7%7C0cf3ddc638a5480885f1cae22925a1b0%7C0%7C0%7C638616397805835247%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=Wq%2FzT%2BGc9rK%2FseSBd8A5qY0wngedAMApRvGmRiH%2F8rU%3D&amp;reserved=0\">17.5098</a>, <a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.parlament.ch%2Fde%2Fratsbetrieb%2Fsuche-curia-vista%2Fgeschaeft%3FAffairId%3D20175305&amp;data=05%7C02%7Czs.kanzlei%40parl.admin.ch%7C16c0a6cbfa8d44bccb8608dcd23af1c7%7C0cf3dd